      "supported_finding": "In curl 8.10.1, --fail-with-body converts a fully received HTTP 400+ response into exit error 22. It does not extend the transient HTTP retry set. Both successful-transfer results without a failure option and error-22 results with a failure option enter the same response-status switch, which allows only 408, 429, 500, 502, 503 and 504. Retrying other error statuses requires the separate retry-all-errors fallback, which the candidate explicitly disables.",
